` is affected, the `payments-api` rollback may need reconsidering.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_016YzbPYka1As33v8W3q4w2j", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01MJH1kw3ZNTGMHr2tABbbrh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The name \"payments\" isn't recognized by the status lookup, so I'll try the likely variants.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01EqVe4mtDjUR9zkfNjxsDPp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service", "confidence": 0.5}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01JrkZXUNiyZC92VJFqjGBKM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.7}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01F8wiDajbGsVvotLhYYErWN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payment-service", "confidence": 0.4}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01NPJZx3pq438pe8qFZJVKST", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.4}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Found `payments-api`: it's unhealthy at v5.1.0 with an 18% error rate. Next I'll pull its release history to find the most recent version that was healthy in production."